  2.         capture confirm variable `var'
  3.         if _rc == 0 {
  4.             capture tostring `var', replace force
  5.             capture replace `var' = trim(`var')
  6.             capture destring `var', replace force
  7.         }
  8.     }

. capture destring mes_13, replace force

